<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Ross Churchley</title><description>A field notebook, kept in the open</description><link>https://rosschurchley.com/</link><item><title>Photo of the day for 2026-09-09</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2026/moon-cn-tower/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2026/moon-cn-tower/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.BwikxX4b_Z1ssEe.webp&quot; width=1680 height=2240 alt=The moon at dusk is framed by trees and a distant CN tower&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2026-09-08</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2026/moon-plane/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2026/moon-plane/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.C1elGDTT_ZmAYrd.webp&quot; width=4754 height=2674 alt=A plane passes in front of a quarter-moon&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Allspice is one spice</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2026/allspice-is-one-spice/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2026/allspice-is-one-spice/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Allspice&quot;&gt;Allspice&lt;/a&gt; is just one spice, namely the dried fruit of the &lt;em&gt;Pimenta dioica&lt;/em&gt; plant. It’s called allspice because the English thought it combined the flavours of cinnamon, nutmeg, and clove.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There’s an obvious joke in there about English cooking, so I fact-checked it. While the average 17th-century village shop only offered four spices, well-stocked grocers &lt;a href=&quot;https://bura.brunel.ac.uk/handle/2438/31460&quot;&gt;had up to nineteen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2026-09-07</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2026/moon-batchelor/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2026/moon-batchelor/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.Dwn6-28C_Z1iTpV1.webp&quot; width=1536 height=2048 alt=The crescent moon hovers over a fully-silhouetted house on a hill.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2026-09-06</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2026/moon-moondog/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2026/moon-moondog/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CqNLJ2zX_Z1d8Bn8.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A partially-eclipsed moon illuminates a halo of clouds&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Kulshan from Oak Bay at sunset</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2026/painting-kulshan/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2026/painting-kulshan/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/cover.2eiorcZP_2nYg5b.webp&quot; width=3636 height=2727 alt=A brightly-coloured painting depicting a distant mountain under a purple, red, and pink sky.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;I’m continuing to experiment with different paint media and styles. This piece is gouache on laser cut wood. The composition is based on a photo I took back in 2007, and the style was inspired by an &lt;a href=&quot;https://bellamyhomestudio.com/collections/diy/products/paint-by-number-art-kit-howe-sound-squamish&quot;&gt;art kit from Meghan Bellamy&lt;/a&gt; I recently did.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gallery-grid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gallery-item&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/C615C1F4-6B7B-45B4-80D7-47F52C93538F_1_105_c.D-G548nY_70izS.webp&quot; srcset=&quot;/_astro/C615C1F4-6B7B-45B4-80D7-47F52C93538F_1_105_c.D-G548nY_2roF6o.webp 640w, /_astro/C615C1F4-6B7B-45B4-80D7-47F52C93538F_1_105_c.D-G548nY_Z1ngPrx.webp 750w&quot; alt=&quot;A photo of Kulshan (Mount Baker) at sunset from across the Juan de Fuca Strait&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; sizes=&quot;100vw&quot; data-astro-image=&quot;full-width&quot; data-astro-image-fit=&quot;cover&quot; data-astro-image-pos=&quot;center&quot; width=&quot;768&quot; height=&quot;1024&quot; class=&quot;gallery-item__image&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gallery-item&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/IMG_2565.DIbkVIqP_ZaSF7i.webp&quot; srcset=&quot;/_astro/IMG_2565.DIbkVIqP_Z1bMQ2M.webp 640w, /_astro/IMG_2565.DIbkVIqP_15HKR1.webp 750w, /_astro/IMG_2565.DIbkVIqP_Z2s8c4g.webp 828w, /_astro/IMG_2565.DIbkVIqP_1qpxbO.webp 1080w, /_astro/IMG_2565.DIbkVIqP_rn838.webp 1280w, /_astro/IMG_2565.DIbkVIqP_ZryMMk.webp 1668w, /_astro/IMG_2565.DIbkVIqP_1xj87q.webp 2048w, /_astro/IMG_2565.DIbkVIqP_Z2hFCct.webp 2560w&quot; alt=&quot;An abstract watercolour-on-wood painting of Átl’ḵa7tsem (Howe Sound) based on a design by Meghan Bellamy&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; sizes=&quot;100vw&quot; data-astro-image=&quot;full-width&quot; data-astro-image-fit=&quot;cover&quot; data-astro-image-pos=&quot;center&quot; width=&quot;2814&quot; height=&quot;3482&quot; class=&quot;gallery-item__image&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-07-12</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-canada-line-marine/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-canada-line-marine/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 12 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.C3cHO_wy_Z19HL2f.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A pair of blue and silver trains travel along a curved elevated railway track.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-07-11</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-canada-line-tunnel/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-canada-line-tunnel/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 11 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.DlIj3h96_ZXPLsY.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=An empty subway tunnel extends into the distance. The closest part of the tunnel is illuminated by a blue LED or a blacklight. The rest of the tunnel has white lights spaced at intervals.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-07-10</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-skytrain-raindrops/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-skytrain-raindrops/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.BJMartHf_oiHSR.webp&quot; width=1936 height=2592 alt=Raindrops streak down a window, obscuring a view of the train tracks ahead. The light suggests that the sun may be setting soon in clearer skies to the right of frame.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-07-09</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-dc-metro/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-dc-metro/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.B_ZzbU77_ZNDzFw.webp&quot; width=3264 height=2448 alt=A subway train is stopped at a platform. Red lights mark the edge of the platform, and the elliptical ceiling is half-illuminated.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-07-08</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-model/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-model/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 08 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CkGJktHM_2f9BAu.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A model train on an elevated track passes a green signal light.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-07-07</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-antique-shinkansen/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-antique-shinkansen/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.Dl7j36pl_1GuCMP.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=Spacious seats in the interior of an original 1960s bullet train.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-07-06</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-vanishing-point/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/trains-vanishing-point/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.uDVVK4O6_13FOlr.webp&quot; width=3024 height=4032 alt=A pair of train tracks and overhead wires run straight past a platform and into the distance.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-17</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-blue-crow/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-blue-crow/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 17 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.BazyBm_P_xJFTE.webp&quot; width=3872 height=2592 alt=A crow perches on a thin branch against a bright blue sky.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-16</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-baby-castle-pigeon/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-baby-castle-pigeon/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.C6FbyQDs_Z1DiHsc.webp&quot; width=2304 height=3072 alt=A tiny, fluffy bird stands on a glass surface next to a stone wall.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-15</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-pne-crows/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-pne-crows/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 15 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.BqjHvRGr_20lL2Y.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A flock of crows populate the trees in front of a red and white tower.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-14</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-eagle-looking-up/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-eagle-looking-up/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.B_0_4Oli_1PPkxg.webp&quot; width=3872 height=2592 alt=A bald eagle looks intently upwards. The bird&apos;s profile is framed by out-of-focus green leaves.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-13</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-kamloops-flock/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-kamloops-flock/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.I6YhRgCy_Z25mrls.webp&quot; width=2048 height=1536 alt=Several birds fly across a blue sky over a tree-lined street.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-12</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-sleeping-duck/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-sleeping-duck/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.BFEQ3mnS_1BPqnR.webp&quot; width=3872 height=2592 alt=A duck sits nestled in grass. Its feathers are dark with white markings, and its eyes are closed with its wing covering its bill.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-11</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-intertidal-seagull/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/birds-intertidal-seagull/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.D7zWxWjM_ShrrN.webp&quot; width=2490 height=1587 alt=A seagull floats on the water filling an intertidal zone. A wet, rocky surface is in the background.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-10</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-coquihalla-forest/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-coquihalla-forest/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 10 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.Cj_QLhTF_Z2fJtMu.webp&quot; width=2048 height=1536 alt=Snow-covered mountain peak rises prominently above a dark, forested landscape. The peak is sharply defined against a dusky sky.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-09</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-japan-river/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-japan-river/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 09 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CHS3MKku_Z2uLjHW.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A wide river flows between gravel banks, spanned by a concrete bridge. Snow-capped mountains rise steeply in the background.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-08</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-tofino-tree/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-tofino-tree/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 08 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.D9aUWmAO_ZBvKiL.webp&quot; width=3726 height=2493 alt=A lone tree stands atop a rocky cliff overlooking the ocean. Waves lap against the base of the cliff under a bright sky.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-07</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-sunset-seagull/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-sunset-seagull/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 07 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.BuDztEt7_1qMolV.webp&quot; width=3872 height=2178 alt=A bird soars over a calm body of water with snow-capped mountains in the distance. The sunset sky is a mix of orange and blue.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-06</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-rockies/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-rockies/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 06 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.B0R4lcJl_Z1kIJFk.webp&quot; width=1536 height=2048 alt=A snow-covered mountain viewed from above. White clouds partially obscure the peak.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-05</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-kamloops-xp/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-kamloops-xp/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 05 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.DIBlnBYJ_wOQnT.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt= A sagebrush-covered hill rises against a clear blue sky.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-04</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-rockies-inukshuk/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/mountains-rockies-inukshuk/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 04 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.Bbrft6EY_NrP03.webp&quot; width=1679 height=1678 alt=An inukshuk on a rocky outcrop with a backdrop of snow-covered mountains under a cloudy sky.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-03</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-kenrokuen-tree-ropes/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-kenrokuen-tree-ropes/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CAsaMxMh_ZKPjek.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A helmeted Japanese worker in the branches of a pine tree looks upwards. Many ropes are suspended from a tall pole out of frame and are being tied to the tree&apos;s branches for support.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-02</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-hillside/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-hillside/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CKqswL26_twfxu.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=Metal posts secured with cables support a grassy hillside, for erosion control or earthquake preparedness.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-05-01</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-power-station/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-power-station/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 01 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.Gi86g7ff_ZRB3u5.webp&quot; width=3741 height=2806 alt=A large rectangular concrete building sits on the water at the base of a forested mountain.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-30</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-post/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-post/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CV9zgihR_ZK4JYh.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A metal post is driven into a mossy rock with the blue water of Burrard Inlet in the background.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-29</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-church/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-church/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 29 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.Bsi-K8jx_ZoRkN2.webp&quot; width=3072 height=2304 alt=A stone church tower is being repaired with scaffolding, while a modern glass skyscraper is being constructed in the background.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-28</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-drainage/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-drainage/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.BJxBr4nZ_iqu04.webp&quot; width=5893 height=3315 alt=Inside a small drainage channel filled with water and debris. The channel&apos;s metal walls are textured with ridges.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-27</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-crane/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/construction-crane/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 27 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.D6NGCxBB_klRUW.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A yellow tower crane rises against a partly cloudy sky, with the focus on the operator&apos;s cab.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-19</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-grazing-cow/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-grazing-cow/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 19 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CH4NN3io_1GCyj8.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A black cow grazes in a field, lowering its head to eat grass.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-18</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-winter-horses/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-winter-horses/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 18 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.lveHum-e_ZUXd0F.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=Two horses stand together in a field. One is brown, and the other has a spotted coat. The ground is covered in frost, and a forest of bare beech trees is in the background.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-17</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-turtle-gathering/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-turtle-gathering/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 17 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CG1Gj1-M_Z1LXf6H.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=Three turtles sit on a dark log surrounded by green lily pads and white flowers in a pond.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-16</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-ueno-fish/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-ueno-fish/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 16 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.C94EMgOq_22oOuj.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=Two fish face the viewer, open mouths poking above the surface.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-15</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-pig/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-pig/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.BPPt3eU4_SYozU.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A light grey pig stands in a grassy field, looking directly at the camera with a curious expression.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Watercolour linocut</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/watercolour-linocut/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/watercolour-linocut/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/cover.Ce3N329e_1Sliet.webp&quot; width=2956 height=2217 alt=A seagull in blue ink stamped on top of a watercolour wash suggestive of a cloudy sky&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;A couple weeks ago I did a beginner’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linocut&quot;&gt;linocut&lt;/a&gt; workshop at the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.slicevancouver.ca&quot;&gt;Slice of Life Art Gallery&lt;/a&gt; in East Vancouver. The process was fun and simple: sketch something on tracing paper, transfer the graphite onto a rubber block, then carve out the relief. We stamped our designs on watercolour backgrounds we painted at the start of the workshop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gallery-grid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gallery-item&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/IMG_2319.BEREz88N_J9KD0.webp&quot; srcset=&quot;/_astro/IMG_2319.BEREz88N_Z2bbokV.webp 640w, /_astro/IMG_2319.BEREz88N_ZoIds6.webp 750w, /_astro/IMG_2319.BEREz88N_Fdmzt.webp 828w, /_astro/IMG_2319.BEREz88N_Z1ylDmK.webp 1080w, /_astro/IMG_2319.BEREz88N_Z275yOn.webp 1280w, /_astro/IMG_2319.BEREz88N_xnwOL.webp 1668w, /_astro/IMG_2319.BEREz88N_1XWq6s.webp 2048w, /_astro/IMG_2319.BEREz88N_25MNmQ.webp 2560w&quot; alt=&quot;A pencil sketch of a seagull silhouette on a pink rubber block.&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; sizes=&quot;100vw&quot; data-astro-image=&quot;full-width&quot; data-astro-image-fit=&quot;cover&quot; data-astro-image-pos=&quot;center&quot; width=&quot;2772&quot; height=&quot;2079&quot; class=&quot;gallery-item__image&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gallery-item&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/IMG_2328.BNMVTeXZ_Z1rzX0h.webp&quot; srcset=&quot;/_astro/IMG_2328.BNMVTeXZ_2iJBXM.webp 640w, /_astro/IMG_2328.BNMVTeXZ_ZYYkWj.webp 750w, /_astro/IMG_2328.BNMVTeXZ_4Wf5g.webp 828w, /_astro/IMG_2328.BNMVTeXZ_lf7xn.webp 1080w, /_astro/IMG_2328.BNMVTeXZ_ZctMTf.webp 1280w, /_astro/IMG_2328.BNMVTeXZ_2rYiJT.webp 1668w, /_astro/IMG_2328.BNMVTeXZ_Z1bCVMl.webp 2048w, /_astro/IMG_2328.BNMVTeXZ_Z14MyvW.webp 2560w&quot; alt=&quot;A relief carving of a seagull made from a rubber block. The carving has been used as a stamp and has blue ink on it. A pile of pink shavings is in the background.&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; sizes=&quot;100vw&quot; data-astro-image=&quot;full-width&quot; data-astro-image-fit=&quot;cover&quot; data-astro-image-pos=&quot;center&quot; width=&quot;4032&quot; height=&quot;3024&quot; class=&quot;gallery-item__image&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I made two designs — a simple seagull on a sky-blue background, and a more experimental depiction of a fire hydrant.&lt;label class=&quot;sidenote-ref&quot; for=&quot;fn-hydrant&quot;&gt;1&lt;/label&gt; I’m quite pleased with how both turned out!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;input class=&quot;sidenote-toggle&quot; id=&quot;fn-hydrant&quot; type=&quot;checkbox&quot;/&gt;
&lt;aside class=&quot;sidenote&quot; data=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Eagle-eyed readers will notice that, although the watercolour gives the vibe of a fire hydrant, the &lt;a href=&quot;/2024/what-colour-is-a-fire-hydrant/&quot;&gt;colour scheme&lt;/a&gt; doesn’t exactly match that of anywhere in BC — all municipalities that have yellow-bodied hydrants with potentially red bonnets would also colour the side caps red. But that wouldn’t have come across in the medium.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gallery-single&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gallery-item&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/IMG_2399.DLB13Ir2_1k4kyn.webp&quot; srcset=&quot;/_astro/IMG_2399.DLB13Ir2_1CLit.webp 640w, /_astro/IMG_2399.DLB13Ir2_12prIN.webp 750w, /_astro/IMG_2399.DLB13Ir2_Z13rYW9.webp 828w, /_astro/IMG_2399.DLB13Ir2_2riHnj.webp 1080w, /_astro/IMG_2399.DLB13Ir2_Z1aOSsB.webp 1280w, /_astro/IMG_2399.DLB13Ir2_Z1kSFqI.webp 1668w, /_astro/IMG_2399.DLB13Ir2_25CRdR.webp 2048w&quot; alt=&quot;A black outline of a fire hydrant stamped on a watercolour background that evokes a red and yellow fire hydrant, a blue sky, and green grass.&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; sizes=&quot;100vw&quot; data-astro-image=&quot;full-width&quot; data-astro-image-fit=&quot;cover&quot; data-astro-image-pos=&quot;center&quot; width=&quot;2374&quot; height=&quot;3324&quot; class=&quot;gallery-item__image&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-14</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-crab/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-crab/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.D2AZiWYA_10okqu.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A dark crab stands on a wet sandy surface, partially submerged in the foam of an incoming wave.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-13</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-squirrel/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/animals-squirrel/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.C56683LS_1PMmTv.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A squirrel sits on a log, holding and eating a seed with its paws.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-12</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-ljubljana-graffiti/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-ljubljana-graffiti/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.Cu-xLFmK_2vmnHY.webp&quot; width=3072 height=2304 alt=A wall covered in large graffiti illustrations, including a blue cartoonish Moomin-like character. An elderly woman is walking with a cane on the adjoining sidewalk.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-11</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-quebec-covered-bridge/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-quebec-covered-bridge/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 11 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.zlmXRXIM_22dacq.webp&quot; width=2304 height=3072 alt=Two people sit on a tall concrete ledge which supports a covered bridge.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-10</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-kanazawa-castle/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-kanazawa-castle/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 10 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.BbmXTkda_Z17H0vn.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=The stone foundation of a Japanese castle and the white lower walls of the keep. One of the keep windows is decorated with an ornate gable.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-09</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-usask-diamonds/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-usask-diamonds/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CNMNrL70_1cHN8q.webp&quot; width=1494 height=1494 alt=Light reflects off a modern glass building, projecting a diamond pattern on the brick wall of the facing building.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-08</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-bird-mural/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-bird-mural/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 08 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CrF0pTCx_20U7N0.webp&quot; width=3056 height=2292 alt=Five stylized, pink birds in flight are painted on a sky-blue concrete pillar. A lens flare emanates from the top left corner.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-07</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-otemachi-mosaic/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-otemachi-mosaic/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.1sgs6DJa_eie1.webp&quot; width=6000 height=4000 alt=A tile mosaic featuring rectangular sections of different patterns. Some sections are built from green and white square tiles; others have interesting patterns in larger panes of partly-frosted glass.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-06</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-ljubljana-roman/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/walls-ljubljana-roman/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/_astro/src.CgL51EoU_BnQ69.webp&quot; width=3072 height=2304 alt=A bottom-up view of an ancient stone wall, covered with some grass and plants. The blue sky and a fluffy white cloud are visible above the wall.&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>Photo of the day for 2025-04-05</title><link>https://rosschurchley.com/2025/flowers-delphinium/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://rosschurchley.com/2025/flowers-delphinium/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 05 Apr 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubD